N5008 [temp.deduct.type] + [temp.variadic]/4-5.  A NON-type parameter pack
DEDUCED from a class-template-id argument (`I` from matching `seq<I...>` against
`seq<1,2>`) and expanded as call arguments in the body (`add(I...)`).  Fixed by
recording the deduced pack's element values in pack_expr_map (guess_template_
args), expanding the pack to its full arity in the guessed template arguments,
and expanding the non-type call-argument pack in the body.  The index_sequence-
style deduction core of std::apply.  Non-vacuous: the assertions would read a
wrong value under the old behaviour.
